/target
# Packaging output (cargo-packager .app/.dmg); regenerated by the release flow.
/dist
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig
.DS_Store

# Local agent/editor state.
/.claude/
# Semantic-search embeddings cache (regenerated locally by the indexing tool).
/.embeddings.cache.json

# Root-level binary disk/tape fixtures (some are copyrighted) — kept local, not
# committed. Rust integration tests live under crates/*/tests and skip when the
# fixtures are absent, so CI stays green without them.
/tests/

# A common macOS global gitignore (~/.gitignore_global) carries `Icon?` to drop
# custom-folder-icon files; case-insensitively that also matches our app-icon
# directory `icons` (icon + s), hiding the bundle icons from `git add`. Force
# the directory and its contents back in so packaging works for everyone.
!crates/mediaexplorer-gui/assets/icons/
!crates/mediaexplorer-gui/assets/icons/**
